  "description": "Romantic Wedding Clipart Bundle is an elegant collection of 58 PNG illustrations created for beautiful wedding and love-themed projects. This set includes romantic bride and groom elements, a floral wedding arch, wedding cake, champagne glasses, wedding rings, church, bridal dress, bouquet, perfume bottle, envelopes, doves, and delicate blush pink roses with greenery.\nThe illustrations are designed in a soft watercolor style with a romantic pastel palette, making them perfect for classic, vintage, garden, and luxury wedding designs. This bundle is ideal for designers, crafters, wedding planners, and print-on-demand sellers who want to create elegant and emotional products.\nInstant download.\nYou will receive:\n— 58 PNG files with transparent backgrounds\n— Size: 4000 x 4000, 4000 x 6000 pixels, 300 dpi\nPerfect for:\n– wedding invitations\n– Save the Date cards\n– wedding menus, seating charts, table numbers\n– wedding websites and banners\n– social media design\n– cards, tags, stickers\n– wedding albums and scrapbooking\n– bachelorette party and bridal shower decor\n– printable kits\n– POD products: mugs, posters, pillows, t-shirts\n– branding for wedding planners, florists, and photographers",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Romantic Wedding Clipart Bundle is an elegant collection of 58 PNG illustrations created for beautiful wedding and love-themed projects. This set includes romantic bride and groom elements, a floral wedding arch, wedding cake, champagne glasses, wedding rings, church, bridal dress, bouquet, perfume bottle, envelopes, doves, and delicate blush pink roses with greenery.</p>\n<p>The illustrations are designed in a soft watercolor style with a romantic pastel palette, making them perfect for classic, vintage, garden, and luxury wedding designs. This bundle is ideal for designers, crafters, wedding planners, and print-on-demand sellers who want to create elegant and emotional products.</p>\n<p>Instant download.</p>\n<p>You will receive:</p>\n<p>— 58 PNG files with transparent backgrounds</p>\n<p>— Size: 4000 x 4000, 4000 x 6000 pixels, 300 dpi</p>\n<p>Perfect for:</p>\n<p>– wedding invitations<br>\n– Save the Date cards<br>\n– wedding menus, seating charts, table numbers<br>\n– wedding websites and banners<br>\n– social media design<br>\n– cards, tags, stickers<br>\n– wedding albums and scrapbooking<br>\n– bachelorette party and bridal shower decor<br>\n– printable kits<br>\n– POD products: mugs, posters, pillows, t-shirts<br>\n– branding for wedding planners, florists, and photographers</p>",
